 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello there, how are you doing today?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_12",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm okay, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_21"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My mother's visiting and she always criticises how I keep the house. How do I not get defensive?",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It helps to decide in advance which comments you'll just let slide. A calm, I'll think about it, ends most of them without a fight.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait, that can't be right.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_12",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Let me double-check. I'd still stand by it, but tell me what you heard.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.97,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "But some of it is really personal, like about my job.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then it's fair to set a boundary. Something like, I know you care, but I'd rather not talk about work this visit.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "She'll sulk.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "She might, for a bit. Sulking usually fades faster than resentment does, though.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay. And if she starts rearranging my kitchen",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "which she absolutely will?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.37,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Give her one cupboard she's allowed to organise. It sounds silly, but it lets her help without taking over.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ha, that might actually work.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "block": "family_visit.dlg4"
  }
 ],
